'''The Mean Tournament''' was a Swedish {{Abbr|RQ|Real Quake/Net Quake/Vanilla Quake}} 3on3 tournament organized in [[1999]].

From the website: "I'll be damned ... welcome to The Mean Tournament. Your clan will never be the same again! Gives guaranteed rise to sour mines and probably the clan's death."

